			59</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A kind of garlic</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 19,
				6, 34, § 116</span></i>.</div>
